# Build context of deploy/fly/ocw-server/Dockerfile (the repository root):
# only what `cargo build -p ocw-server` needs. rust-toolchain.toml stays
# out (the image's Rust is the same version, without the extra targets).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!apps
!crates
!services
!proto
!assets
!artwork/logos
# Bevy's patched renderer: Cargo.toml's [patch.crates-io] points at it, and
# cargo needs every patch path to resolve the workspace, even for ocw-server.
!vendor/bevy_render
# The shipped models (ocw-assets embeds them; the server's collisions take
# the props' shapes from them): pull the LFS files first, pointer files
# give the server no shapes.
!artwork/3dmodels
!deploy/fly/ocw-server/start.sh
**/target
**/node_modules
